{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蒙牛乳業上半年多賺近一成六，純利有23.7億元人民幣，不派中期息。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期內，收入接近448億元人民幣，按年增長百分之7.8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T01:14:02.473015+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":61,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}